                  0.0,
                  0.0,
                  1.0,
                  830.0,
                  1364.0
                ],
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "text": "accept is not \"finished\". accept (step 6) only means the user agreed to open the URL, so it can arrive before the page is submitted; Open WebUI sends it the moment the link is clicked. The server keeps the call open (yellow bar) until step 11; if accept comes after the page was submitted, the wait ends at once. On 2025-era connections elicit_url goes through the SDK shim (elicitation/create, no step 12); elicit_url_legacy_push uses the push API and sends step 12.",
                    "style": {
                      "font_family": "Inter",
                      "font_style": "Regular",
                      "size": 14.5,
                      "tracking": 0.0,
                      "baseline_shift": 0.0,
                      "h_scale": 100.0,
